      "subtitle": "",
      "status": "Draft",
      "notes": "# Result Summary\n\nOutlook category: **CanDoItAllSummaryTest**\nMessage count: **1**\n\n## Evidence Table\n\n| Source | Sender | Subject | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Outlook message `AAMkAGRmMWViOTA2LTMzNGItNGNjNi1hMThmLWY2ZjA2ZTA1NjU4NwBGAAAAAABzw7m6jM_ATK0mFMmFWzQABwCKp9BRbAdVSoi7nuYgsTwNAAAAAAEMAACKp9BRbAdVSoi7nuYgsTwNAAUlI8yQAAA=` | tomas.svo1@gmail.com | Tetris Game Development | \"We need to program a simple Tetris game\"; \"in the form of a website\"; \"mobile application... later\"; \"controlled with the keyboard\"; \"save the last maximum score\"; \"do not want a backend\"; \"host it on a regular static web hosting\"; \"within one week at the latest\" |\n\n## Concrete Findings\n\n- Customer requests a **Tetris game** for the **web** first.\n- **Mobile app** is a later/optional extension if complexity allows.\n- Controls must be **keyboard-based** (arrow keys or WASD).\n- Progress/score storage must be **local in-app only**; **no backend**.\n- Deployment target is **static web hosting**.\n- Delivery timing requested: **within one week**.\n\n## Open Gaps\n\n- No technical stack or framework preference is specified.\n- No design, gameplay, or level-of-polish requirements beyond basic functionality.\n- Mobile app scope, if pursued, is not defined.\n\n## Recommended Next Actions\n\n1. Confirm preferred web stack and hosting constraints.\n2. Clarify whether the mobile app is out of scope for the first release.\n3. Break the request into implementation tasks for core gameplay, scoring persistence, and deployment.\n4. Validate whether the one-week deadline is firm.",
